Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:11.24,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,The first time I could barely \Nbelieve such a person could exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.71,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,it was my own sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.96,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Not only was she a first-class mage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:18.16,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,she was also a martial arts machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:21.96,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,That's why I always lost against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:24.61,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,We were two years apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:27.80,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,but when asked if I would be \Nat her level in two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:28.78,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I was always skeptical.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:38.00,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I even started to believe that \NI'd never catch up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:41.34,main - flashback,Suzune,0,0,0,,You're a genius, Yukine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.57,main - flashback,Suzune,0,0,0,,I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:48.90,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,But I realized at an early age
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:54.22,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,that it was because father and mother \Npoured their hearts and souls into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:58.96,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I suppose both of them had fallen \Nin love with her swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:02.70,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,It was painfully obvious why they \Nstopped paying attention to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:08.38,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,After all, the one who was most enchanted \Nby her swordsmanship was me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.64,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,My sister is a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:13.90,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Maybe at magic I had a shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:18.07,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,but with the katana I'd never surpass her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:23.65,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,It's not like I thought I \Nwas completely talentless,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:27.84,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,but that's precisely why \NI picked up the naginata.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:31.89,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Because I had some amount \Nof talent for the katana,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.89,0:01:35.10,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I was all the more aware of \Nhow amazing she is with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:39.72,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,That was the first time I fled...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.63,sign_8204_57_Night_Sky_Cave,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(320,312)}Six Months Later
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:57.01,main,Suzune,0,0,0,,I am no genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:59.75,main,Suzune,0,0,0,,If you want me to be a genius so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:01.33,main,Suzune,0,0,0,,you have to admit it, Yukine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:05.53,main,Suzune,0,0,0,,You're also a genius, so aim for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:10.16,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,In my stead... huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.49,0:03:45.62,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,So that's how the ability assessments \Nat Tsukuyomi Magic Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.45,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,are performed over the \Ncourse of several days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:47.45,sign_7422_35_Ability_Assessme,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H574F29&\fs18\move(494,35,490,38,29,2948)}Ability Assessment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:47.45,sign_7422_35_Ability_Assessme,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H574F29&\fs16\pos(389,191)}May 12th-\NMay 16th
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:47.45,sign_7422_35_Ability_Assessme,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H574F29&\move(223,220,226,218,29,2948)}Written
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:47.45,sign_7422_35_Ability_Assessme,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H574F29&\fs16\move(135,220,141,217,29,2948)}Practical
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:47.45,sign_7422_35_Ability_Assessme,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H574F29&\move(46,217,52,217,29,2948)}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:50.87,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,The combined score is derived from \Nthe written and practical tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.46,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,as well as the dungeon clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:56.34,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,As this is the first time for you, \Nyou might be a bit nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.46,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,As the school rankings \Nwill be made public,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:00.88,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,make sure to continue your preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:05.68,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Hey, Takioto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:07.68,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:11.43,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,What exactly are you doing \Nwhen you skip class?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:12.89,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.85,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I'm going into dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:17.23,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Nah, you know that can't be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:18.69,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,There are rumors going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:20.69,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,It seems there are people \Nwith too much free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.95,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master, I bet they are lower \Nlife forms whose only skills
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:24.95,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,are speaking badly about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:27.70,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Never say that to the other students.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:29.08,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,What rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:33.12,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,I mean, using some weird device \Nin a ritual to worship the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.92,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,having connections to \Na shady office,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:39.67,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,or secretly selling a fish brand lotion...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.42,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I guess they're not\N completely fabricated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.88,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,What?! It's true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.59,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,It appears we just had a sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:46.89,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Apparently a pink-haired \Nwoman took out a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:48.76,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,That's Ms. Ruija!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:51.18,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I knew I should have gone \Nwith an allowance for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.02,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:53.60,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Let's go to a dungeon after school!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.64,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Why would I go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:57.40,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Iori, you should come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.77,0:04:59.77,main,Iori,0,0,0,,I can come?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.40,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:07.45,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Just so you know, first-years aren't \Nallowed to go to dungeons alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:08.91,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,No teacher will give you permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:10.87,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But one actually did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.66,main,Iori,0,0,0,,That's a permit slip from Ms. Ruija!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.58,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Damn, she's our homeroom teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.42,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I guarantee that it'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.92,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I plan on asking someone from \Nthe Morals Committee as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.17,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,The Morals Committee?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.63,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Ludie, you'll join us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.17,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I hear you're running every day now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.38,main,Iori,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:28.64,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,I guess princesses also work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:30.51,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,But how does Takioto know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:31.31,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.89,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Well, if we have permission, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:37.02,main,Iori,0,0,0,,Same for me. Thanks, Kousuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.15,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Then it's settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:45.49,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Hey, I really hope it's a \Nnormal dungeon this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:46.86,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.95,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,We're going to need\N a more combat-oriented power
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.33,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,for the upcoming in-game event.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:56.04,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,In order to prepare for that, \NI need everyone to get stronger soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.83,main - top,Iori,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:56.04,main - top,Yukine,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:58.79,sign_10576_96__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,[Beginner Dungeon, 1st Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:00.79,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Easy prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:01.59,main,Iori,0,0,0,,And one for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.80,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Those two are quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.51,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yes, and they'll probably \Nget much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:13.01,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Iori and Katorina, you can \Nignore all the enemies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.02,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.52,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Because, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.35,sign_10576_96__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(322,308)}[5th Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:34.16,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,All we're doing is running!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:36.41,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,What's the point of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:38.37,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Ludie, you seem totally fine still.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:42.13,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,I was recently taught that building \Nstamina is the foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.88,main,Iori,0,0,0,,You guys are all so tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:47.30,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But you're keeping up just fine yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:49.09,main,Iori,0,0,0,,True! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:51.59,sign_10576_96__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,458)\pos(322,309)}[9th Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:52.55,main - top,Nanami,0,0,0,,We made it on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:55.93,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:57.52,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,We're not done yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:07:01.69,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,If we run into a 4-way intersection, \Nit's north, west, west, south.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:05.77,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,If it's a T intersection, it's south, \Nsouth, east, south, east, north.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:06.73,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:09.24,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Um, Kousuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:18.95,sign_12550_121_Resume,SIGN,0,0,0,,Resume
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:18.95,sign_12550_121_Resume,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(304,115)}Reset
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:22.17,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master, that was 1 hour and 58 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.46,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Two minutes left. That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:26.21,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:27.34,main,Iori,0,0,0,,One hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:35.64,main,GoddessStatue,0,0,0,,You have done well to defeat the \Nevil and stand here before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:39.52,main,GoddessStatue,0,0,0,,For your achievement, \NI will grant you a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.69,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:44.86,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Give us a proper explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:48.07,main,Iori,0,0,0,,Are we allowed to get skills this easily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:48.98,main,Iori,0,0,0,,Kousuke-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:53.95,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Here's a table that summarizes \Nthe eight maze layouts and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:57.91,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,the five skills you can get \Nfrom the goddess statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:07:59.62,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Please make good use of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.41,main,Iori,0,0,0,,That's too much. I can't accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:05.63,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not something\N to give out to people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.09,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Well, I was hoping we could \Nall get stronger together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.00,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:10.26,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:15.64,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Even if he wants to get stronger together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.72,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Kousuke's really strange, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.81,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Yukine-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:27.56,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,The first time I could barely \Nbelieve such a person could exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:28.32,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,it was my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:31.40,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,It happened again when \NI entered the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:34.15,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,There I met President Monica, \Nnicknamed the Goddess of War,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:36.57,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,and the Principal with \Nseemingly endless powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:41.70,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I thought that nobody else \Ncould surprise me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.79,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Some day, I would be able \Nto catch up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:46.67,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,With that belief, I worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:48.29,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:53.09,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Then Takioto Kousuke appeared, \Nand he's younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.68,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,He's not normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:08:59.35,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,physically or mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:01.64,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,It wouldn't even be so \Nwrong to compare his
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:06.19,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,ever-increasing mana capacity to the \Nsource of mana, the "Dragon Vein."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:11.78,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,When I learned that he can't use \Nemission magic, I was relieved...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.61,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I still remember that day so vividly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:18.28,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,When he came to talk about weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.70,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I gave him a katana and watched him swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:25.66,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Maybe my standards were high \Nfrom having seen my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:29.00,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,but I thought to myself \Nthat he has no talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:33.96,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,But, a few days later, he left me shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:39.34,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,His sword swings looked like he'd \Nbeen practicing them for years...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:46.89,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,He might be able to learn one of the \Nsecret techniques of Kyohachi-ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.77,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,That technique, the one \Nthat was so peculiar
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:53.11,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,they said even my sister \Ncouldn't learn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:06.66,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:11.21,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Um, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.00,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:19.38,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Well... I thought your naginata \Nwasn't as beautiful as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.55,0:10:22.60,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Not beautiful... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.35,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Is something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:26.81,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I was thinking about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:28.60,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:32.06,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Normally this is not something \NI should be telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:34.27,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,but a part of me wants to do just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:38.65,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,And I feel like I might be able to \Nreach the answer I've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:41.74,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,The one about how strong \NI am able to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:46.29,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,There's someone I considered my goal, \Nsomeone I thought I could never beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:49.71,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Well, it's my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:51.38,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,But she said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.71,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,"Yukine, you can be \Nnumber one in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.55,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,So aim for that in my stead."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.67,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,And I ended up promising I would...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:02.51,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I think you could be \Nnumber one in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:04.43,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I would get in your way though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.68,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Listen until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:11.44,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Anyway, even as the years have\Npassed and I've grown,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.61,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,my sister is always ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:17.15,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Even though she's no \Nlonger in this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.74,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Since they couldn't talk\N about it in game,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.11,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I don't know any of the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:24.49,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,but her sister passed \Naway at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:27.99,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Even then, I kept up my training \Nand came to this academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:30.87,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,When I saw President Monica or \Nthe Principal, I realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:35.88,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I sort of understand that \Npeople are counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:38.76,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Some, like yourself, even \Ntold me directly to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:45.05,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,But I always wonder if I\N can meet those expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:50.89,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Remembering my sister's words, I have \Nbeen trying to get stronger, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:53.40,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Senpai, if I may...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:56.36,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Maybe this is just my ego talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.11,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,so I'd like to hear it from you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:01.49,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Do you want to get stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:04.99,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:09.58,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Let's go to a dungeon together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:22.42,sign_10576_96__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(546,1)}[Dayspring Labyrinth]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:19.42,main - top,Yukine,0,0,0,,It's called Dayspring Labyrinth,\N but it doesn't seem very labyrinthine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:22.42,main - top,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Actually, this place is definitely \Na labyrinth of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:25.93,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,You see, here you have to \Nclear your own labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:28.31,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,My own labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:32.35,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,And depending on the person, \Nthese can be hard or easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:35.73,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,In a way, you can face off \Nwith the strongest person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.86,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Isn't that weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:43.15,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,You can enter as a party, but \Neverybody has to fight on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:45.78,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,So you mean, you can \Nstart off as a group,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:49.28,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,but everybody fights a different \Nmonster individually?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.95,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yes. If you defeat the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:58.21,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,it is possible to join your \Nfriends in battle and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:13:01.67,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Looks like we have to split up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:03.26,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:05.93,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Senpai, I'd like you \Nto remember one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:06.68,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:09.14,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,The enemy you'll face in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:11.06,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,It's not an insurmountable foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:13.27,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:14.18,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I can win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:18.23,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yes, though you might \Nfeel unsure of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.61,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:21.94,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Please trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:23.99,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,If you can't, and something \Nwere to happen to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:26.45,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I will take care of you \Nfor the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.83,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,So I don't even mind \Nif you lose on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.20,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I will go in ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:49.01,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:51.22,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:52.85,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,With a katana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.60,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,How can it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:01.90,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Suzune-neesan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:06.90,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,So this dungeon is different from others,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:09.91,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,and there's only one monster per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:12.95,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,You end up facing the person \Nyou think is the strongest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:15.54,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,or the person who caused \Nyou the most trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:19.96,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Senpai will probably have \Nto face her own sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.42,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,That's the only thing that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:25.30,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,For me, it's most definitely him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:27.88,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:29.55,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.68,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Here I go, Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.73,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Oh, you're using magic too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:44.61,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I guess that's to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.53,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,He's a manifestation of potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:48.99,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,the protagonist of MagiEx, Hijiri Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:50.66,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Then how about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:55.33,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:02.17,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Hijiri Iori contains infinite potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:07.42,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,He can specialize in physical stats \Nto be a close combat expert,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:11.09,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,or he can specialize in magic \Nto be a ranged expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.93,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,It's true that he's strong, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:17.56,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,the "Hijiri Iori" I know wasn't this weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:21.23,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,That's right. There's \Nno way he is this weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:23.36,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,If we're going only by potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:28.49,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,the only one who could match him\Nacquiring spells would be Nanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:29.78,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.07,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I have a power he doesn't have!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.41,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,The real Iori is much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:37.49,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,He gets stronger and then \Nhe will stand before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:42.75,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,So then... can I afford\N to lose against this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.96,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,If I want to face someone \Nwho outclasses this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:48.05,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,is this enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:50.26,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:57.51,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Overwhelming! It needs to \Nbe an overwhelming victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.89,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,This is Iori's shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:01.35,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,This isn't Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:04.94,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,The Iori I'm going for \Nis the strongest Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.49,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,It's slow for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.28,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,But it's steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:17.62,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,That's how Iori is growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:22.29,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I'm sure that I'm stronger right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:24.54,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Yes, for a while I'll be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:27.71,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,But Iori is going to gain on \Nme with an explosive pace soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:30.26,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Actually, I'm in trouble \Nif he doesn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:33.80,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,That's necessary to guide all the \Nheroines to the happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:36.55,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,And I need to get even stronger as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:39.22,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:50.98,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,You are not Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.99,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I'll go to Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:04.00,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,One of my first thoughts was that I \Ncouldn't win against my sister Suzune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:07.79,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,No matter what we did, or how many \Ntimes we did it, I couldn't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.50,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Even as a child I was \Nimpressed by my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:14.72,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,and maybe the age difference \Nwas part of the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:19.22,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,But it didn't take me all that long to \Nlearn that it was actually her talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:23.77,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,That's when I thought that I would \Nnever be able to surpass her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:27.94,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,And, as if to prove me right,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:31.02,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I was never able to win \Nagainst her a single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.78,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,This really feels like her swordsmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:37.49,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Then... this means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:43.62,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,It's like she sees right through me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:47.79,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:51.54,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,By suddenly speeding up, she \Nmade it harder for me to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:55.76,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,That didn't connect?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.68,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Calm down. Cut her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:03.06,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Yes, her attacks are very similar \Nto the attacks of the sister I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:05.73,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Redirect... and cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:06.89,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:09.60,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Yes, it always ends up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:13.57,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,No matter how much effort I put in,\N my sister is ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:18.49,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,And then there's President Monica, \Nand even further ahead is the Principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.45,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,To my side there are Shion and Fran,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:27.87,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,while Takioto and Ludie \Nare chasing after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:32.92,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,All of them have their own unique talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:37.30,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Why did my sister tell me that \NI could be number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:39.26,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:43.22,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I didn't realized the \Nnaginata was this heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:46.64,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,And that a shadow could be so big...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:53.44,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,She doesn't even consider me an \Nenemy worth fighting any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.69,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,It's true, right now \NI'm not worth anyth—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:57.44,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:00.91,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Takioto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:04.66,main - flashback,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Please trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:06.29,main - flashback,Kousuke,0,0,0,,If you can't, and something \Nwere to happen to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.58,main - flashback,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I will take care of you \Nfor the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:12.00,main - flashback,Kousuke,0,0,0,,So I don't even mind \Nif you lose on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:18.76,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,It's like a bad line from a love story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:20.97,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,But why is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:23.47,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,that all this power is \Nflowing into me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:29.89,main,Suzune,0,0,0,,Yukine, everyone calls me \Na genius, but I'm a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:31.73,main,Suzune,0,0,0,,And so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.31,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:34.90,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:37.69,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,My sister was a genius and a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:41.91,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,But I am also a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:44.28,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,We're both humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:46.28,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,There's no reason that \NI can't surpass her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:47.95,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,I'll show you my full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:51.12,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,If I fail, I'll just have \NTakioto take me in as his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:53.83,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,That sounds fun in its own right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.71,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzune-neesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:20:00.51,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Even since your death, \NI've always kept on training.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:02.30,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I've honed my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.47,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Let me show her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:06.43,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,Let me show Takioto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:08.77,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,This is the path that I've walked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.56,main - italics,Yukine(M),0,0,0,,These are my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:15.19,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Please witness my current self, \Nthe current Mizumori Yukine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.11,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,She regenerated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.61,0:20:23.91,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,This shadow's much more tenacious...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:32.25,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:37.25,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Swords, katanas, and naginatas\N all share this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:40.21,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,The flash of the blades carry a "soul."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:43.80,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:46.14,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Those slashes carried a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.26,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Takioto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:54.77,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:20:56.85,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,This is what I adored!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:21:01.15,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,One of the Big Three, the Water Dragon \NPrincess, the skillful Mizumori Yukine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:05.24,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,The secret technique that secured \Nher spot on MagiEx's Big Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:10.24,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Nine-Headed Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:26.47,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Takioto, may I ask this question again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:27.47,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.51,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:30.89,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:33.43,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.43,0:21:36.48,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,There's nothing for you to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.82,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I am aware that my actions \Ndo arouse suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:42.15,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,This time too...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:44.07,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's why I do want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:46.57,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But could I ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:48.91,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,could I ask you to wait \Njust a little bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:50.28,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:53.08,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I understand that this is not \Nan easy thing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:54.08,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:57.87,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,If anything happens, no matter \Nwhen, I want you to come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:00.79,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I want to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:01.84,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.92,0:22:04.96,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Now let's go home and train!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.21,0:22:06.05,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:09.97,sign_35245_386_Reborn_as_a_Side,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\move(313,70,313,80,30,4993)}"Big Three"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:09.97,sign_35245_386_Reborn_as_a_Side,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\move(313,194,314,196,30,4993)}Mizumori Yukine

